    "给好友发送的新消息会分别加密同步到本人的其他活跃设备。不会迁移旧历史，也不会自动转发收到的同步副本。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New sent messages are separately encrypted for your other active devices. Old history is not migrated and received copies are not forwarded again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给好友发送的新消息会分别加密同步到本人的其他活跃设备。不会迁移旧历史，也不会自动转发收到的同步副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天：双棘轮加密" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chat: Double Ratchet encryption"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天：双棘轮加密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天使用独立版本的经典双棘轮协议。首次设备身份来自服务器目录并在本机固定；尚无带外安全码核验。旧版实验与聊天会话分开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chat uses a versioned classic Double Ratchet protocol. Device identities are pinned on first use from the server directory. Out-of-band safety codes are not available. Legacy experiments are separate from chat sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天使用独立版本的经典双棘轮协议。首次设备身份来自服务器目录并在本机固定；尚无带外安全码核验。旧版实验与聊天会话分开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天框 · 仅显示认证通过的消息" : {

    },
    "聊天消息加密后发给好友的有效设备。已存储不代表对方已读；下拉聊天页可拉取新消息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Messages are encrypted for your friend's active devices. Stored does not mean read. Pull down to sync."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
